          "title": "显示器布局",
          "content": "<p>程序员的工作台，往往放着1到 n 台显示器。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202602/bg2026022410.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>有人总结了这些显示器的放置方法，你属于哪一种？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202602/bg2026022409.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
